Build dependencies (from source)
----------------------------------

Compiler and tools:

  C++20 compiler (GCC >= 11 or Clang >= 13)
  CMake >= 3.16

System packages — Ubuntu 24.04 (x86_64 / aarch64):

  build-essential cmake
  libtbb-dev liblmdb-dev libsqlite3-dev
  libcurl4-openssl-dev libjsoncpp-dev
  zlib1g-dev libbz2-dev liblzma-dev libdeflate-dev autoconf

  Additional for ikafssnhttpd:
    libdrogon-dev uuid-dev libmariadb-dev libyaml-cpp-dev
    libbrotli-dev libhiredis-dev libpq-dev

System packages — Ubuntu 22.04 (x86_64 / aarch64):

  build-essential cmake
  libtbb-dev liblmdb-dev libsqlite3-dev
  libcurl4-openssl-dev libjsoncpp-dev
  zlib1g-dev libbz2-dev liblzma-dev libdeflate-dev autoconf
  libssl-dev uuid-dev

  Note: ikafssnhttpd cannot be built on Ubuntu 22.04
  (Drogon is not packaged for this release). Build with -DBUILD_HTTPD=OFF.

System packages — EL 9 / EL 10 (x86_64 / aarch64):

  gcc-c++ cmake make
  tbb-devel lmdb-devel sqlite-devel
  libcurl-devel jsoncpp-devel
  zlib-devel bzip2-devel xz-devel libdeflate-devel
  openssl-devel libuuid-devel
  autoconf automake libtool

  Requires: epel-release and CRB (CodeReady Builder) repository enabled.

  Note: ikafssnhttpd cannot be built on EL 9/10
  (Drogon is not packaged for these releases). Build with -DBUILD_HTTPD=OFF.

System packages — macOS (Homebrew):

  cmake tbb lmdb sqlite3 curl jsoncpp
  xz libdeflate autoconf automake libtool openssl@3

  Additional for ikafssnhttpd:
    drogon

Conda packaging (recipe/, conda-forge channel):

  Build environment:
    {{ compiler('c') }} {{ compiler('cxx') }} {{ stdlib('c') }}
    cmake make autoconf automake libtool patch curl pkg-config

  Host environment:
    tbb-devel lmdb libsqlite libcurl jsoncpp openssl
    zlib bzip2 xz libdeflate

  Linux baseline: c_stdlib_version 2.34 (sysroot_linux-{64,aarch64}).
  osx-arm64 baseline: MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET 11.0.

  Note: ikafssnhttpd is intentionally not built (BUILD_HTTPD=OFF) because
  Drogon is not packaged in conda-forge.

